{"data":{"body":"**P2:** `submit()` may run the wrapper synchronously\u2014for example, through `CallerRunsPolicy`\u2014and not return until it exits. Because the execution future is bound only afterward, `cancel(true)` during that inline run cannot interrupt it, and cancellation of the subsequently returned completed future is ineffective. Construct and bind a `FutureTask` before calling `executor.execute(...)`, and add a manager-level caller-runs cancellation test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc72tt_u","finding_digest":"c0bf4b7f58fc13ee7b03a6be1837c9005850bec9350b0a11a0d2f07ddf3e1be0","finding_id":"arf_v1_yc7uw72y7qj646ydu27bqn6jab","finding_key":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/executionmanager.java::submitexecutortask::execution-handle-bound-before-run","identity_key":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/executionmanager.java::submitexecutortask::execution-handle-bound-before-run","line":272,"observation_digest":"80169f84a00d42fd6c1412e26c6fef5a2b060df6acf9149425f7269cf457fcec","observation_id":"aro_v1_qalj7bfabvbp23auclrgy37pli","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/ExecutionManager.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_yc7uw72y7qj646ydu27bqn6jab","published_at":"2026-09-29T23:01:45Z","review_id":"arr_v1_pvifnvswvc4hj2cm6rowklgr3x","reviewed_base_sha":"7693b3dabfe3a0b9d410a2560fb0d171ab867536","reviewed_head_sha":"d877354765af8e1b160d31745c598c3a8616f65d","reviewer":"codex","start_line":272,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":731},"record_id":"art_v1_v6xtbwm3omctvgwt6h5m24utly","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-29T23:01:45Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
